(785, 1, 327, '358048522672428', 'Mens T-shirt', '<p><b>Lorem Ipsum</b> is the most famous type of <b>placeholder text</b> (or \"demo text\") used in graphic design, printing, and web development.</p><p>It\'s essentially a block of Latin-like text that is used to fill a space on a layout. The main purpose is to show how a design will look visually when actual content is eventually placed there, without the reader being distracted by meaningful words.</p><p></p><h3>Key Facts About Lorem Ipsum</h3><p></p><hr><ul><li><p><b>Origin:</b> The text is not truly random. It is a scrambled, modified excerpt from <b>Cicero\'s</b> philosophical treatise, <i>De finibus bonorum et malorum</i> (On the Ends of Good and Evil), written in 45 BC.</p></li><li><p><b>The Original Phrase:</b> The most recognizable segment comes from: \"Neque porro quisquam est qui dolorem ipsum quia dolor sit amet, consectetur, adipisci velit...\" which translates roughly to: \"Nor is there anyone who loves, pursues or desires pain itself, because it is pain...\"</p></li><li><p><b>Why It\'s Used:</b> Designers use it because the distribution of letters and word lengths closely mimics that of English and other European languages. This makes it a great stand-in to test fonts, typography, and how text flows in a layout.</p></li><li><p><b>Modern Generators:</b> There are many online tools (like <code>lipsum.com</code>) that can generate paragraphs, words, or lists of Lorem Ipsum text in any length you need.</p></li></ul><p>Do you need to generate some Lorem Ipsum text for a project, or were you curious about its history?</p>', '<p><b>Lorem Ipsum</b> is the most famous type of <b>placeholder text</b> (or \"demo text\") used in graphic design, printing, and web development.</p><p>It\'s essentially a block of Latin-like text that is used to fill a space on a layout. The main purpose is to show how a design will look visually when actual content is eventually placed there, without the reader being distracted by meaningful words.</p><p></p><h3>Key Facts About Lorem Ipsum</h3><p></p><hr><ul><li><p><b>Origin:</b> The text is not truly random. It is a scrambled, modified excerpt from <b>Cicero\'s</b> philosophical treatise, <i>De finibus bonorum et malorum</i> (On the Ends of Good and Evil), written in 45 BC.</p></li><li><p><b>The Original Phrase:</b> The most recognizable segment comes from: \"Neque porro quisquam est qui dolorem ipsum quia dolor sit amet, consectetur, adipisci velit...\" which translates roughly to: \"Nor is there anyone who loves, pursues or desires pain itself, because it is pain...\"</p></li><li><p><b>Why It\'s Used:</b> Designers use it because the distribution of letters and word lengths closely mimics that of English and other European languages. This makes it a great stand-in to test fonts, typography, and how text flows in a layout.</p></li><li><p><b>Modern Generators:</b> There are many online tools (like <code>lipsum.com</code>) that can generate paragraphs, words, or lists of Lorem Ipsum text in any length you need.</p></li></ul><p>Do you need to generate some Lorem Ipsum text for a project, or were you curious about its history?</p>', NULL, '44', '245', 2, '29.04', 77, NULL, '2025-10-20-68f5d1a6d439c.webp', 1, 190, 1, 1, 0, '2025-10-20 06:07:35', '2025-10-28 19:18:35', '454553', NULL),
